# Binary files must never have their line endings rewritten.
#
# core.autocrlf is on for this repository, and without these rules Git guesses
# per file. It guessed wrong for the setup guide PDF and warned that it would
# rewrite it, which would have corrupted the file on the next checkout. Fonts,
# icons and the label images carry the same risk.
#
# Deliberately no "* text=auto" line: adding one would renormalise every
# existing source file in the repository in a single commit.

*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.pyd   binary
*.db    binary
*.zip   binary
*.pfx   binary
*.p12   binary
